{
    "title": "MICO: Go Live Streaming & Chat",
    "description": "<b>Global live stream, Live chat in chat room, Live single & multi-user guest call rooms with friends.</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf1fHighlights\ud83c\udf1f\r\n<font color=\"#BD613E\">\ud83d\udcacChat\ud83d\udcac - Chat with friends global directly</font>\r\n<font color=\"#E78C17\">\ud83e\udd33Moments\ud83e\udd33 - Share your stories and online chat with people </font>\r\n<font color=\"#EACB22\">\ud83c\udfa4Live\ud83c\udfa4 - Live house, live chat, and live party </font>\r\n<font color=\"#2BECA3 \">\ud83c\udf89Party\ud83c\udf89 - Up to 9 people video chat, ready to be on cloud 9 </font>\r\n<font color=\"#2BCEEC \">\ud83d\udca7Purity\ud83d\udca7 - A positive, energetic and healthy environment for you  </font>\r\n\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\r\nMICO is a live streaming app that provides tons of International live streams for users. Here, you can watch talented live streams and make new talented friends, enjoy the live houses with exclusive creativity of broadcasters! Sounds exciting? Let's check it out!\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfa4Live\ud83c\udfa4 - Live streams, live chat, and live party</b>\r\nWatch the international live stream and enjoy live videos. There are high-quality live streamers from the US, Thailand, Malaysia, and so on. They offer thousands of fantastic live shows every day. \r\nDancing, singing, talk show, online game, no matter what talent you have, MICO will be the biggest stage for broadcasting your skills. Everyone can be a star in MICO. New beautiful stickers and filters make you cuter, more beautiful, and more confident in the live video. \r\n<b>\ud83d\udcacChat\ud83d\udcac - Live chat with friends either local or global directly in a chat room.</b>\r\nYou can chat with your favorite broadcasters just one tap away, start an online chat \r\n<b>\ud83e\udd33Moments\ud83e\udd33 - Share your stories with friends.</b>\r\nBy sharing photos and short videos on moments, you will catch your fan\u2019s eyes around you and increase your popularity.\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf89Party\ud83c\udf89 - Up to 9 people live call, ready to be on cloud 9</b>\r\nThe more people watching, the more fantastic the atmosphere will be. Join a group room, start an online party with friends, make new friends, and have fun by expanding your social circle.\r\n\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffc\r\nMeet talented broadcasters in MICO, one of the most popular worldwide social networking apps where you can enjoy an online chat, live streams, get more socialize and watch short videos & photos.\r\nYour happiness is our goal. Feel free to give us any feedback. We are happy to hear your complaints and advice:\r\nEmail: contact@micous.com\r\nTwitter: http://twitter.com/micoapp\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/micoteam\r\nFacebook:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/micoapp\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/micoapp.english",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Global live stream, Live chat in chat room, Live single &amp; multi-user guest call rooms with friends.</b><br>\ud83c\udf1fHighlights\ud83c\udf1f<br><font color=\"#BD613E\">\ud83d\udcacChat\ud83d\udcac - Chat with friends global directly</font><br><font color=\"#E78C17\">\ud83e\udd33Moments\ud83e\udd33 - Share your stories and online chat with people </font><br><font color=\"#EACB22\">\ud83c\udfa4Live\ud83c\udfa4 - Live house, live chat, and live party </font><br><font color=\"#2BECA3 \">\ud83c\udf89Party\ud83c\udf89 - Up to 9 people video chat, ready to be on cloud 9 </font><br><font color=\"#2BCEEC \">\ud83d\udca7Purity\ud83d\udca7 - A positive, energetic and healthy environment for you  </font><br>\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<br>MICO is a live streaming app that provides tons of International live streams for users. Here, you can watch talented live streams and make new talented friends, enjoy the live houses with exclusive creativity of broadcasters! Sounds exciting? Let&#39;s check it out!<br><b>\ud83c\udfa4Live\ud83c\udfa4 - Live streams, live chat, and live party</b><br>Watch the international live stream and enjoy live videos. There are high-quality live streamers from the US, Thailand, Malaysia, and so on. They offer thousands of fantastic live shows every day. <br>Dancing, singing, talk show, online game, no matter what talent you have, MICO will be the biggest stage for broadcasting your skills. Everyone can be a star in MICO. New beautiful stickers and filters make you cuter, more beautiful, and more confident in the live video. <br><b>\ud83d\udcacChat\ud83d\udcac - Live chat with friends either local or global directly in a chat room.</b><br>You can chat with your favorite broadcasters just one tap away, start an online chat <br><b>\ud83e\udd33Moments\ud83e\udd33 - 